    "description": "Runs the same checks as CI — lint, the component library build (Vite + TypeScript), every Storybook story as a render test (Vitest + headless Chromium), the Storybook build, and the website lint + build (Next.js) — before a push to Vercel. Knows the non-standard monorepo build order and watches for SSR-unsafe code, portal regressions, and static generation failures.",
