    "description": "Ships completed work safely: surveys the tree so unrelated files never get swept into a commit, runs the full local verify (lint, story tests, all three builds — mirroring CI) before anything is committed, groups changes into logical conventional commits, pushes, confirms the CI run goes green, and reports exactly what shipped and what was deliberately left out.",
