    "icon": "cycle",
    "description": "Runs one analytics-driven copy experiment end to end: pulls GA4 data, filters bot noise, forms a falsifiable hypothesis about the words on a page, implements the change on a branch in a temporary worktree, verifies the build, and writes a problem / hypothesis / solution report for approval. The only skill here that also runs itself — every Monday, as the loop described on the Loops page.",
